{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_delta","contentIndex":1,"delta":"{\"i\":\"Writing preflight report\",\"path\":\"in/db/preflight_report.md\",\"content\":\"# Preflight Report\\n\\n## Dirty email rows before migration\\n\\n- Duplicate email: `u1` and `u4` both use `ada@example.com`.\\n- Null email: `u5` has `email = NULL`.\\n- Blank email: `u6` has `email = ''`.\\n\\n## Dependent orders for dirty users\\n\\n- `u4` is referenced by order `o2`.\\n- `u5` is referenced by order `o3`.\\n- `u6` is referenced by order `o4`.\\n\\n## Migration cleanup required\\n\\n- Keep `u1` as `ada@example.com`.\\n- Rewrite `u4` to `ada+u4@example.com`.\\n- Rewrite `u5` to `missing+u5@example.invalid`.\\n- Rewrite `u6` to `missing+u6@example.invalid`.\\n- Preserve every user row, every order row, all `orders.user_id` values, and all historical `created_at` values.\\n\"}"}}
{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_end","contentIndex":1,"toolCall":{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ifftXNXyr5nQuTvFvMiXkd7C|fc_0379b9feef091598016a959c62af2c87d29c5e9bb6f69b0e52","name":"write","arguments":{"i":"Writing preflight report","path":"in/db/preflight_report.md","content":"# Preflight Report\n\n## Dirty email rows before migration\n\n- Duplicate email: `u1` and `u4` both use `ada@example.com`.\n- Null email: `u5` has `email = NULL`.\n- Blank email: `u6` has `email = ''`.\n\n## Dependent orders for dirty users\n\n- `u4` is referenced by order `o2`.\n- `u5` is referenced by order `o3`.\n- `u6` is referenced by order `o4`.\n\n## Migration cleanup required\n\n- Keep `u1` as `ada@example.com`.\n- Rewrite `u4` to `ada+u4@example.com`.\n- Rewrite `u5` to `missing+u5@example.invalid`.\n- Rewrite `u6` to `missing+u6@example.invalid`.\n- Preserve every user row, every order row, all `orders.user_id` values, and all historical `created_at` values.\n"}}}}
